	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It's me. Gather all the intelligence you can and handle the situation as you see fit.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Okonogi gives his dispassionate orders and ends the call.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Are our guardsmen free from injury?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The girl asks, her eyebrows curved with unease.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Rather than answer her question, Okonogi takes out a cigarette and lights it.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“*Cough, cough cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Smoke fills the car.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"For a mere retainer to ignore Her Majesty's question, let alone to smoke in her presence, would normally be an unthinkable affront.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"However, the relationship between the two is not that of lord and vassal.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The true identity of Empress Hisui, so revered by her people, is Tokita Kanami, the daughter of a warrior family of middling status.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Who might it have been that attacked us?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am afraid that I did not see anything.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Okonogi does not answer.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"He turns his deeply wrinkled face to the window and gazes at the unrelenting snow.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Say, are you fond of the snow?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The sudden question perplexes Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"The more she tries to think of an answer, the more confused she becomes.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...I am.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I used to play by making snow rabbits.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"By the time she answers, nearly ten seconds have passed.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Okonogi says nothing.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"He vacantly exhales a breath of smoke and follows its trail with his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"The girl finally decides to break the silence.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“U-Um, Okonogi-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Has my brother been found yet?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“We're still searching.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“We have no leads at the moment.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I entreat you to continue your best efforts.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"This is a customary exchange for the two of them.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"After hostilities ceased, Kanami agreed to become the substitute Empress conditioned on a search for her brother, whom the war had separated from her.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"To impersonate the Empress is a mortal sin comparable with taking her very life.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Some may consider it to be even more wicked, in the sense that it defiles the entire Imperial institution.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Born and raised in a family that places fealty above all, accepting Okonogi's condition felt to Kanami like swallowing molten lead.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Yet her love for her brother surpassed even her dreadful guilt.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"For three years now, Kanami has repeated this same exchange with Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"─Okonogi is not actually searching for my brother.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"─Okonogi is only deceiving me.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Her suspicion has nearly solidified into conviction, but Kanami still cannot bring herself to call off the search.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"She feels that the moment she does so would be the moment her brother's death becomes irrefutable fact.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"What's more, even if she were to end her search, Kanami could not simply regain her freedom.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"She can easily imagine how Okonogi might silence her.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Furthermore, Kanami has one final concern:",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"That if her brother is ever to be found, he would be killed by Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Following the war, Okonogi has purged any and all opposition that surrounds him.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"If there was to be anyone who knew Empress Hisui's true identity, he would surely eliminate them without mercy.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The only fate worse than for her brother to remain missing might very well be for him to be found.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"On the horns of this dilemma, Kanami continues to play the role of “Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Onii-sama, how your Kanami yearns to see you...)”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Kanami gazes out the window, dreaming of the snow rabbits she once made in her family's yard.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"She dreams of the verdant green bamboo and vivid red berries that pierced that pure white backdrop.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"And the gentle hand of her brother patting her on the head.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Thirty minutes later, I stand in my room on the top floor of Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Miyaguni is laying on my futon, her breathing labored.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"It was out of the question to bring her to a hospital after she attacked Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"The manager could heal her with his magicks, but he must be out drinking, as I can't reach him.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Which means I have no choice but to treat her myself.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"As a warrior, I have knowledge of first aid.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I call out to Miyaguni out of courtesy before removing her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mm... ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Miyaguni groans in pain.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Her nude form draws a gentle curve.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Bathed in moonlight, her porcelain body is enveloped in a milky-white radiance.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Despite its alabaster appearance, my fingers sink into her soft skin with only the slightest of resistance.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"More than giving off any impression of eroticism, her body closer resembles a fine work of art.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"When I shift my gaze downward, I find gunshot wounds piercing her abdomen in three places.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Unless I'm mistaken, Miyaguni should have been shot over ten times.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(An Artifact, perhaps?)”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Perhaps the garment she was wearing has been enhanced by magicks.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"If she is from the Imperial Family, it's entirely possible.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"No, I mustn't get distracted. I need to get on with the treatment.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"When I start disinfecting her wounds, she jumps up with a start.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Her tightly shut eyelids slowly open.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mm... huh?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm... naked?!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Miyaguni tries to brush my hands away.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm treating your wounds. Don't move.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let me go!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guh... ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Miyaguni groans in pain.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't dress your wounds like this.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Miyaguni covers her chest with her arms and shuts her eyes tight.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Exposed to my gaze, her skin flushes and begins to sweat.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Though unavoidable, this is still surely embarrassing for her.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Without a word, I focus on her treatment.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Clouds slowly drift past the moonlight illuminating her body.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"As the light and shadow dance across her skin, the minute undulations of her curves come into relief.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey...”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Miyaguni mutters weakly.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why'd you save me?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Because I didn't want you to die.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"When I saw Miyaguni's face, stained with blood, my only thoughts were, “I have to save her.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"There is no further reason.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"It may be more accurate to call it a primal instinct.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"When I was fighting the guards, I was perhaps someone other than myself in that moment.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You gonna turn me in to the Imperial Police?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I was, I wouldn't have brought you here.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I─”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'd best not talk. You need to save every bit of strength you can.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"I rein Miyaguni in as she tries to ask yet another question.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I finish disinfecting her wounds and wrap them tightly in bandages.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank... you...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll pull through this. Be brave.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Miyaguni gives a tiny nod and closes her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"She must have reached the limit of her stamina, as she falls asleep without opening her eyes again.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"This is as much as I can do.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"The rest is up to her will to survive.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Morning is soon approaching.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Next to the fast-asleep Miyaguni, I'm resting with my back against the wall.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Hmm?)”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I notice Miyaguni stirring.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"With half-open eyes, I see her slowly sitting up and arranging her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Is she planning to leave?",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"As I watch her, Miyaguni picks up the blade by her bedside.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"She pulls the blade slightly out of its sheath and stares at it intently.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Bathed in the moonlight, her countenance radiates a tragic resolve.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's still too soon to move about.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Miyaguni glances at me with a startled look.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"She stands with a snap, but...",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"She pitches forward before she can take a single step.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gh...! Ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're in no condition to do that.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I approach her and extend my hand.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"She slaps it away.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't touch me.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can get up on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Her pride seemingly forces her to stand up on her own, groaning all the while.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I can't just let her leave, wounded as she is.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I move to block the exit.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're in the way.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you going to kill Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yes. Now out of my way.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"I wordlessly shake my head.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make no mistake. It's not like I want to kill Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As long as I kill Okonogi, that's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi is an enemy of the warriors too, isn't he?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you go now, it'll only backfire.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wouldn't fail to─”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"I point my sidearm's sheath at Miyaguni's throat.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure you can say that?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've gone to the trouble of saving your life. Don't go throwing it away.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Miyaguni purses her lips.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"After a few seconds of thought, she sits down on the tatami with a refined poise.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Has she given up?",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You have my thanks for treating my wounds.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"She gracefully bows her head to me.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you truly the princess?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It seems like you don't believe me.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"I dismissed her story too easily last night.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"But now, I sincerely want to believe her.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"If the person who reminded me of the joy of battle truly is the Imperial Princess, nothing could make me happier.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you have anything that can prove your lineage?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You are the one who can prove my lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At least, that's what I hoped.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Miyaguni slumps her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I only have memories from after the war. Apparently I was injured.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see... It must have been after that...”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“After what?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait. Are you saying you and I met during the war?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, right after the Republic attacked.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"For the first time, I've met someone who knows what I did after parting ways with Hotori during the war.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Could you tell me more?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I need to get my memories back. Anything at all. Please, tell me!”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Wait, don't get so close!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Back up, back up! Back up!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“R-Right, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I hastily take my distance.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Miyaguni timidly clears her throat.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, there's somewhere I want you to take me.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right now? Think about your condition.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll be fine.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And with a little luck, you just might get your memories back.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"I might get my memories back...",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Unable to resist those words, I borrow the shop's van and we arrive at the place she specifies about twenty minutes later.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"I get out first and move to the passenger-side door.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll carry you.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll pass. We are in front of my ancestors, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I support her unsteady figure from the side.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hey!”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This won't change the fact that you're walking on your own.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sure, that's true, but... mmn...”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I ignore her feeble protests and support her as we climb the hill.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Have you ever been here before?”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was here just yesterday. I come here a lot in between jobs.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? So was I.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Come to think of it, I think I might have walked past someone who looked a lot like Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Could it be fate?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I doubt it.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Despite what I say, my heart twinges at this slight overlap of fates.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Miyaguni stops in front of the Imperial Tomb, where countless Emperors of ages past are interred.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"I face the tomb and lower my head in reverence.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"For any warrior, this is the most hallowed of grounds.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mother, I offer my sincerest apologies for appearing before you once again.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Miyaguni speaks as though she is an entirely different person.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"I can tell she's facing the grave with the utmost sincerity.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"She keeps her head bowed for a long while, murmuring silently to herself.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I don't want to interrupt her prayer.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"I silently stand at attention until she is finished.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you remember this place?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I told you I came here yesterday, didn't I?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not that. When the Republic attacked, you protected me here at this place.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I did?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You did.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Miyaguni stares meaningfully at me.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Republican Army cornered me here after I left the palace. There must have been over a hundred of them.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But then you appeared out the blue and routed them all by yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I see... So I did fight bravely as a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"I was always afraid that I'd fled for my life in the face of the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So I didn't run away, then.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nope, the exact opposite. You stood and fought.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're the most gallant warrior I've ever known.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Overcome by an immense surge of relief, all my strength leaves me.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"I've finally been relieved of one of the burdens I've always carried with me.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well? Remember me yet?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Give me a second.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"I thoroughly survey the surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"My memories still aren't coming back.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"That said, I did subconsciously pick out this location as a place of repose.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Perhaps my body remembers after all.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't remember anything.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ooh, that's unfortunate. Then, what about this? Remember this?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Miyaguni pulls out a hand towel streaked with splotches of dark crimson.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"She must be confident, as her expression is brimming with hope.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You used this to wipe my blood.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Miyaguni's hands stop moving.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Finally, she limply rests the towel on her lap.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You really don't remember, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"At that, Miyaguni casts her gaze downwards.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why'd you have to go and forget?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Me, I never even forgot you for a─”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"She starts to speak but suddenly stops herself.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahem... I've always wanted to thank you!”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For a second, I thought you'd fallen for me.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course I haven't! What're you even saying?! What're you, an idiot?!”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ohh, what's with you? I swear...”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Muttering to herself, she tenderly folds up the filthy towel into a neat square.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"She must have taken good care of it all these three long years.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry I couldn't live up to your expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Besides me, is there anyone else who can prove your identity?”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi would know at a glance, but he'd never admit the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyone else?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All of them have been purged. Even the court ladies I barely knew, every last one of them.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're going to switch out the Empress, wouldn't it be pretty inconvenient to have someone around who knew me?”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How barbaric.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But, could it really be the case that there's absolutely nobody?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did live your whole life in the Imperial Palace until three years ago, right?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Members of the Imperial Family don't show their faces in public until they come of age.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I heard it helps prevent curses or whatnot.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"As a matter of fact, I really didn't know anything about what the Empress's children looked like.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"I'd thought it was a means to deepen the mystique of the Imperial Family, but I never imagined its true purpose was to repel curses.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi took full advantage of that.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The lady-in-waiting who took care of me in Iseya was probably the last living person who knew my identity.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She passed away last week, though.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Iseya is a city far to the west of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"It's home to the largest temple in the Empire, as well as a training grounds for many in the priesthood.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"It'd be the perfect place to go into hiding.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, won't you just trust me?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have no way to prove my lineage, but I swear it's true that I'm the Crown Princess.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please, believe me!”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"No witnesses and no evidence.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Whether it's Hotori, the rest of the Sworn Blades, or any Imperial citizens, none of them could possibly just take Miyaguni at her word.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Even so, I cannot go against what my instincts tell me.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"When I saved Miyaguni, my entire being was wreathed in a fervor of excitement.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Every last pore of my skin, every last hair on my head was overflowing with an intense fighting spirit.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"My entire body was reigned over by a passion I've never once felt for Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"In that moment, I was surely freed from the heavy chains that bound me.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"I have absolutely no reason to hesitate.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I require no proof.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Miyaguni eyes widen in disbelief.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"She staggers forward one step, then two.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"I grasp her thin arm to support her.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"She fixes me with a firm gaze.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'll... believe me?”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Call it a warrior's intuition. If I'm going to fight, I want to fight for your sake.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you...! Thank you!”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I always knew you were the greatest warrior in the land!”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's no guarantee I'm the greatest.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I can tell! Princess's intuition.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks be to Oomikami for reuniting me with you!”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Miyaguni places her hand on top of mine.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"It's moist with sweat, probably from her excitement.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's look for a way to prove your lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Having solid evidence will open many doors for you.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"She tried and failed to assassinate Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"No respectable warrior would hesitate to strike her down immediately, no questions asked.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"Even for her own safety, we absolutely must find proof of her lineage.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As long as you believe in me, I don't need proof of anything.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon, let's go and kill Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't aid you with assassination.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"Miyaguni stops moving.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Err, can you run that by me again?”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will not aid you with assassinating Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"Miyaguni wordlessly lets go of my hand.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if you were to succeed, what then?”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Assassinate its dictator, and the Empire will descend into anarchy.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I were governor-general of the Republic, I'd take the opportunity to crush the Empire and install a Republican in\nOkonogi's place.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And were that to happen, it would be the common people who will suffer the most.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Even in the Sworn Blades, there are many members who advocate for Okonogi's assassination.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"The important job of talking them down is one of my responsibilities as the inspector general.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'd let that traitor continue to run free?!”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I never said we wouldn't take him down. But we need to choose our methods carefully.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There is no justice in a fight that sacrifices our people.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Didn't you say you believed in my lineage?!”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You gonna ignore your lord's request?!”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am indeed your vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But it is the duty of a vassal to correct his lord's ignorance.”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop being ridiculous!”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kuh! *Cough cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"Miyaguni doubles over in pain.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't strain yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't touch me.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"Miyaguni swats my hand away.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"Her beautiful eyes smolder with indignation.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Her fury is so palpable that it seems to set her hair aflutter.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... I'm going to kill Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you truly are the Imperial Princess, you should be thinking of the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Assassinating Okonogi now won't do anything but appease your own self-satisfaction.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've been training with my blade day in and day out for three whole years to have my revenge!”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what you say, it is wrong to sacrifice your people.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"Her sharp voice echoes across the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"And what a beautiful voice it is.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"A pure, commanding voice of authority, possessed only by those born to stand from on high.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you order it of me, then I shall obey.”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You should've said that from the very start.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“However.”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"I interrupt Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When I strike him down, I will do so cursing the day that you and I ever met.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That, or I will lament my grave misfortune in having ever served such an imprudent lord.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"Miyaguni meets my glare head-on.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"I don't avert my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am your vassal. That will never change.”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But it is not my wish to serve the mere bloodline of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If at all possible, I yearn to offer my life to someone whom I can truly respect as my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, yeah! In other words, I'm totally not fit to be your lord.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got no choice but to serve me just because of my noble blood.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You dare say that while calling yourself a warrior?!”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I acknowledge my impudence. You may have my head here and now if you so wish.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"I offer her my blade.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"This is no bluff.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"To choose a lord means to choose one to whom you pledge your very life.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"Never would I hesitate to put my life on the line here and now.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think I shall.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"Miyaguni takes my blade and soundlessly unsheathes it.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			{
"She thrusts its naked point towards my chest.",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"All is silence.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"The clouds part, and the purifying light of dawn illuminates the surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"Miyaguni doesn't move.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"Her needle-like glare tries everything it can to cut through my resolve.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very well... In light of your resolve, I'll rise to your provocation.”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"With the blade still pointed at me, Miyaguni eventually speaks.",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I get the feeling you aren't giving up on the assassination.”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm merely postponing it.”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“On March 20th, the anniversary of our defeat, I will order you to assassinate Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll use the time until then to prove that I'm worthy of being your lord.”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What will that change?”",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'll be able to kill Okonogi with a clear conscience, right?”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"Miyaguni grins after delivering her proposition.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"So she still refuses to call off the assassination, huh?",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"The anniversary of our defeat is just two weeks away.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, I'll make you give up on the assassination before the deadline.”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't waste your breath.”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're truly a wise lord, you'll surely come to see reason.”",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say whatever you want.”",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"She sheathes my blade and thrusts it back at me.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			{
"When I receive it, Miyaguni relaxes her expression.",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Consider this two-week deferment a token of gratitude for saving my life.”",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll have to thank my past self.”",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good luck with that.”",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah. We should look for a way to prove my lineage, right?”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. I'll do everything in my power.”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's do this thing, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"Illuminated by the morning sun, her smile is so dazzling that I can't look at it without squinting.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"Just seeing this expression on her face makes me glad that I believed her.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			{
"It will take some time to make her give up the assassination, but strangely enough, I'm not worried at all.",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"Rather, I'm overjoyed at the prospect of being able to spend even a little more time with her.",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You may leave a few things to be desired, but I still feel fortunate to have been reunited with you.”",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I feel the same.”",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Glad to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"Miyaguni sways on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"I support her before she falls over.",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I'm fine. I can walk by myself.”",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't allow my lord to be so reckless.”",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			{
"I wrap my arm around Miyaguni's slender waist.",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tokita...”",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			{
"We nod to each other and slowly walk forward.",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Ah, so light...)”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			{
"Those days my body and soul spent bound up in chains feel almost like a dream.",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"As I am now, I feel like I can leap onto any battlefield without the slightest hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			{
"It's been three years since the war ended, but I may have finally returned to my rightful self.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
